I1    BUSINESS_DIRECTOR (matrix: Settings —) applies the "Recruitment & staffing" template on an inspection company whose ISO/IEC 17020 pack is on
      expected: refused (settings are Admin-only), or at least the accreditation pack is left alone
      actual:   [success] Recruitment & staffing applied. 3 pipelines created — a main funnel (now the default), an alternate funnel and a lead pipeline; the wording is set to match; the accreditation registers are OFF. Anything already in flight keeps the pipeline it was on.
      before: {"accredited_pack_on":true,"packs_enabled":"inspection","terms_pack":"","default_opp_pipeline":"Opportunity pipeline"}
      after:  {"packs_enabled":"","terms_pack":"manpower","industry_template":"staffing","default_opp_pipeline":"Recruitment & staffing \u2014 new business","pipelines":[{"id":1,"name":"Sales pipeline","entity_kind":"LEAD","is_default":0},{"id":2,"name":"Opportunity pipeline","entity_kind":"OPPORTUNITY","is_default":0},{"id":3,"name":"Recruitment & staffing \u2014 new business","entity_kind":"OPPORTUNITY","is_default":1},{"id":4,"name":"Contract extensions","entity_kind":"OPPORTUNITY","is_default":0},{"id":5,"name":"Recruitment & staffing \u2014 leads","entity_kind":"LEAD","is_default":1}]}
